Now SeoController. RSS and sitemap. Use BlogService. Need XML escape.

```ts
@Controller()
export class SeoController {
 constructor(private blogService: BlogService, private config: ConfigService?) 
 @Get('rss.xml') async rss(@Req() req,@Res() res) {...}
 @Get('sitemap.xml')...
 @Get('robots.txt')...
}
```
Sitemap includes posts published, categories, static pages. Use baseUrl. Set `res.type('application/xml')`.

